{"4788610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jugger - the video game", "steam_appid": 4788610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The best Jugger video game ever is finally here!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it is an easy claim, as this is the only one ;) </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But what is Jugger?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jugger is a unique team sport that combines the objective-driven gameplay of rugby with the weapon duels of fencing. Two teams battle to get the Jug (the ball in the middle) and place it the opponent's goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most combat games, in this game there are no pre-set attack animations. Your weapon follows your mouse movement directly, giving you full control over every strike. Victory depends on your timing, precision, and teamwork—not on memorizing combo chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras/3ef994939e1bdc7e9ce0bc3714d6075c.avif?t=1784792210\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras_big/3ef994939e1bdc7e9ce0bc3714d6075c.avif?t=1784792210 width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Win Duels. Work as a Team. Score Goals.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two teams of five compete to carry the Jug across the field and score in the opponent's goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team consists of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Runner, the only player allowed to carry the Jug (an elliptical yellow ball).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Fighters, armed with a variety of weapons whose task is to clear a path for their Runner and stop the enemy team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a player is struck by a weapon, they must immediately go down on their knee and are temporarily out of play. Every duel matters. Every opening can decide the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras/7c13963b8467951bbfa6ad3a7d8b9c72.avif?t=1784792210\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras_big/7c13963b8467951bbfa6ad3a7d8b9c72.avif?t=1784792210 width=1560 height=846 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your weapon directly with your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No preset attack animations. <br>No ability cooldowns.<br>No auto-combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swing, stab, and block is generated by your movement, creating combat that rewards practice, positioning, and precision. Like in Half Sword, just a bit simpler</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras/db3d38777a1da5afdc990a18f122ce2d.avif?t=1784792210\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras_big/db3d38777a1da5afdc990a18f122ce2d.avif?t=1784792210 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the agile Runner or master one of five distinct weapon classes, each with its own strengths, weaknesses, and fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer aggressive offense, defensive control, long reach, or quick mobility, there is a role for you on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras/0454804b0c0dc6a8c930438186d6a56e.avif?t=1784792210\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras_big/0454804b0c0dc6a8c930438186d6a56e.avif?t=1784792210 width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Around the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across 8 unique arenas inspired by locations from around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras/7dfaa12219c58476b676a23f27e87506.avif?t=1784792210\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras_big/7dfaa12219c58476b676a23f27e87506.avif?t=1784792210 width=1560 height=860 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven mouse-controlled combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pre-set attack animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based competitive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Runner or Fighter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique weapons for Fighter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 character skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive team color customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the real-world sport of Jugger</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a longtime Jugger player or discovering the sport for the first time, grab your weapon, support your Runner, and play for fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3... 2... 1... JUGGER!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras/5a1692d5c26959d037107ac0b29d8b9c.avif?t=1784792210\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788610/extras_big/5a1692d5c26959d037107ac0b29d8b9c.avif?t=1784792210 width=1560 height=854 /></span></p>", "about_the_game